Standards-Version: 4.5.1
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 12), rsync

Package: armcb-isp-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms (>= 2.1.0.0)
Recommends: build-essential, linux-headers-generic | linux-headers-arm64
Description: CIX in-tree ISP driver (armcb_isp) DKMS source
 Kernel ISP / camera driver for CIX SoC (armcb_isp.ko), matching
 drivers/media/platform/cix/cix_isp in the CIX Linux tree.
 .
 This package ships source only. DKMS compiles against the running
 kernel on the board (requires CIX kernel headers with PLAT_BBOX / DSM
 options as used by the in-tree driver).
